#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:4
msgid "¿What are the Seals of Excellence?"
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/ckanplugin/templates/snippets/sello/helplers.html:8
msgid ""
"The Digital Government Excellence Seals are a recognition from the "
"Ministry of Information Technologies and Communications (MinTIC) for "
"digital services and open datasets that meet high standards of quality, "
"security, accessibility, and transparency. It certifies that the State's "
"digital products respond to citizens' needs, comply with regulations, "
"promote trust and participation, and guarantee continuous improvement. "
"For open data, it ensures that it is useful, up-to-date, and reusable."
msgstr ""

